[
  {
    "chapter": "c17-garden",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 园门",
    "focus": "grandmother_place",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "话说秦钟既死，宝玉痛哭不已",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-001",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "且说大观园工程告竣，贾珍引着贾政入园查看。但见崇阁巍峨，层楼高起，园中佳木茏葱，奇花闪灼，一带清流，从花木深处泻于石隙之下，端的气象万千。",
    "title": "大观园工程告竣",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "jia_zhen",
        "at": "grandmother_place"
      },
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "zheng",
        "at": "wang_place"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "chapter": "c17-garden",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 园门",
    "focus": "feng_place",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "贾珍先去园中知会众人",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-002",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "贾政看了，摇头道：「这般奢华过甚，将来如何收拾。」贾珍陪笑回说，都是按贵妃省亲的款式办下的，不敢俭省。",
    "title": "贾政叹奢华",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "jia_zhen",
        "at": "feng_place"
      },
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "zheng",
        "at": "wang_place"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "chapter": "c17-garden",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 园门",
    "focus": "grandmother_greet",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "可巧近日宝玉因思念秦钟",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-003",
    "speaker": "zheng",
    "text": "宝玉今日本该在此，怎么不见？快把他唤来，园中诸景须得这孽障随行，也好考他一考。",
    "title": "命唤宝玉",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "zheng",
        "at": "grandmother_greet"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "chapter": "c17-garden",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 园门",
    "focus": "grandmother_greet",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "贾政近因闻得塾掌称赞宝玉专能对对联",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-004",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "不多时宝玉来了，锦衣绣袂，神采飘逸。贾政道：「你且随我入园，各处匾额对联，须你题了才好。」宝玉连声答应，垂手随在身后。",
    "title": "宝玉随行入园",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "baoyu",
        "at": "baoyu_greet"
      },
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "zheng",
        "at": "grandmother_greet"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "chapter": "c17-garden",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 游廊",
    "focus": "tea_place",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "贾政听了，沉思一回",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-005",
    "speaker": "messenger",
    "text": "众清客相公围随在后，一叠声奉承：「世兄才情，我们万不及一。这园子若得世兄题咏，方不负这般景致。」",
    "title": "清客奉承",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "messenger",
        "at": "tea_place"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "chapter": "c17-garden",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 游廊",
    "focus": "daiyu_place",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "贾政刚至园门前",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-006",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "说笑间，一行人步入正园。迎面一带翠嶂挡在前面，白石崚嶒，或如鬼怪，或如猛兽，纵横拱立。贾政便教宝玉，此处置何题方好。",
    "title": "翠嶂当前",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "zheng",
        "at": "wang_place"
      },
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "baoyu",
        "at": "daiyu_place"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "chapter": "c17-tour",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 有凤来仪",
    "focus": "grandmother_place",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "说著，进入石洞来",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-010",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "行不多远，渐向北边，平坦宽豁，两边飞楼插空，雕甍绣槛。此处佳木茏葱，清流激湍，几竿修竹，掩映其间。",
    "title": "有凤来仪",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
