        "at": "baoyu_greet"
      },
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "messenger",
        "at": "tea_place"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "chapter": "c17-tour",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 有凤来仪",
    "focus": "feng_place",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "贾政与诸人上了亭子",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-011",
    "speaker": "messenger",
    "text": "一清客便道：「此处莫若题『淇水遗风』。」又一客道：「『睢园雅迹』也好。」贾政摇头，问宝玉之意。",
    "title": "清客拟题",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "messenger",
        "at": "feng_place"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "chapter": "c17-tour",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 有凤来仪",
    "focus": "grandmother_greet",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "有一客道：“是极，是极。竟是‘泻玉’二字妙。”",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-012",
    "speaker": "baoyu",
    "text": "宝玉道：「这处是贵妃省亲别墅，须要颂圣才是。莫若『有凤来仪』四字。」贾政冷笑：「畜生，倒会取巧。」心中却已暗许。",
    "title": "宝玉题额",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "baoyu",
        "at": "grandmother_greet"
      },
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "zheng",
