  {
    "chapter": "c17-tour",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 稻香村",
    "focus": "tea_place",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "有一客道：“是极，是极。竟是‘泻玉’二字妙。”",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-014",
    "speaker": "messenger",
    "text": "清客们道：「『杏花村』好。」又有人引旧诗：「柴门临水稻花香。」贾政命宝玉再拟。",
    "title": "拟题杏花村",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
