  {
    "chapter": "c17-inscribe",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 题额",
    "focus": "grandmother_greet",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "众人听了，都赞道",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-021",
    "speaker": "messenger",
    "text": "清客们看了，齐声赞道：「『有凤来仪』四字，正暗合贵妃娘娘之兆，此等才情，我等望尘莫及。」",
    "title": "清客称颂",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
