  {
    "chapter": "c17-inscribe",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 题额",
    "focus": "grandmother_place",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "贾政听了，便回头命宝玉拟来",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-022",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "贾政听到「有凤来仪」，猛然想起长女元春如今贵为贤德妃，心中一酸，却又不好形于色，只默默点头。",
    "title": "贾政念元春",
    "actions": [
      {
        "type": "show",
        "actor": "zheng",
        "at": "grandmother_place"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "chapter": "c17-inscribe",
    "scene": "dinner",
    "place": "大观园 · 题额",
    "focus": "daiyu_place",
    "source": {
      "chapter": 17,
      "paragraphLead": "贾政道：“匾上二字容易。再作一副七言对联来。”",
      "textKind": "adaptation",
      "layer": "present"
    },
    "id": "C17-023",
    "speaker": "zheng",
    "text": "贾政转过念头，倒生了几分慈意，道：「你再撰一副对联来，我瞧瞧。」宝玉不慌不忙，念道——",
    "title": "命题一联",
    "actions": [
